# Keep the launcher session (query, results, plugin provider state, selection)
# when another panel (clipboard history, control-center, session, ...) preempts
# it via PanelManager::openPanel. Armed through a new Panel::onPreempted()
# virtual; LauncherPanel consumes the flag in onClose() and restores it in
# onOpen("") by re-running the pipeline with reapplyCurrentQuery() (selection
# restored by identity). Plugin provider caches survive the preempted close,
# so plugin views return synchronously. Esc/app-launch closes still reset.
#
# Upstream: noctalia-dev/noctalia @ 47945ecb84fd6d9284cf82480273fccd20bb1fa9

